<title>CANADA: IPL Energy sets C$111 mln share issue.</title>
<headline>IPL Energy sets C$111 mln share issue.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>IPL Energy Inc said on Monday it agreed with Scotia Capital Markets to issue 3.0 million common shares at C$37.075 each for a total of C$111 million.</p>
<p>The offering, being made only in Canada, was expected to close around October 7.</p>
